From 8d9107f67b348a616aac31c067888a85a2637200 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: sunrisepeak <speakshen@163.com>
Date: Thu, 8 Oct 2026 07:00:28 +0900
Subject: [PATCH] perf(clangd): successful module scans replay all observed
 inputs before reuse

Fresh scanner services expose successful and negative filesystem observations. Replay exact bytes, metadata, alias relationships, directory prefixes and environment before reuse or publication. Bound live memo ownership across concurrent validators, and decline unknown response provenance or unsupported observations.
---
